; SMBShares on the Amiga: the Drobo's share list as guest
FailAt 21
Copy DH0:PrismNet/cfg/dhcp ENV:PrismNet ALL QUIET
C:PrismNet START
Wait 6
Echo "start" >DH0:PrismNet/shares.log
Version DH0:PrismNet/SMBShares >>DH0:PrismNet/shares.log
DH0:PrismNet/SMBShares 192.168.1.11 >>DH0:PrismNet/shares.log
Echo "== ALL" >>DH0:PrismNet/shares.log
DH0:PrismNet/SMBShares 192.168.1.11 ALL >>DH0:PrismNet/shares.log
Echo "== no server" >>DH0:PrismNet/shares.log
DH0:PrismNet/SMBShares NOSUCHBOX >>DH0:PrismNet/shares.log
Echo "DONE" >>DH0:PrismNet/shares.log